// Raw text, inline and as a block. A language becomes a class on the code
// element, which is where the highlighters that run in a browser look for it.

--- raw-inline ---
Call `printf` for that.
│ <p>Call <code>printf</code> for that.</p>

--- raw-block ---
```
line one
line two
```
│ <pre><code>line one
│ line two</code></pre>

--- raw-block-with-language ---
```go
func main() {}
```
│ <pre><code class="language-go">func main() {}</code></pre>

--- raw-escapes-its-text ---
`a < b && c > d`
│ <p><code>a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c &gt; d</code></p>

--- raw-block-escapes-its-text ---
```html
<p class="x">&amp;</p>
```
│ <pre><code class="language-html">&lt;p class="x"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/p&gt;</code></pre>
